 |----------|------------|------------------|----------------|
 | Dotenv | ❌ Plain text | Local filesystem | ❌ No |
 | File (0.19+) | ❌ Plain text | Local filesystem | ❌ No |
+| SQLite (0.22+) | ❌ Plain text | Local filesystem | ❌ No |
 | Environment | ❌ Plain text | Process memory | ❌ No |
 | Null (0.19+) | N/A — no stored value | None | ❌ No |
